      "command": "follow.calendar",
      "phrasings": [
        "import my phone's calendar",
        "sync events from the calendar on this phone",
        "pull in this week's events from my calendars"
      ],
      "description": "Follow the phone's calendars through follow.calendar, one calendar at a time: a field the member never changed follows the phone, one they changed stands, an event the vault does not know is matched by title and start before one is added, a repeating series is one event with its rule and the days the phone skipped or moved, and one gone from a complete read goes to the trash if the member never edited it.",
